<title>GERMANY: German ZEW details 6-mth major nations forecasts.</title>
<headline>German ZEW details 6-mth major nations forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table lists economic and market forecasts for the next six months issued by ZEW Zentrum fuer Europaeische Wirtschaftsforschung GmbH research institute. The averages are compiled from a survey of 295 firms conducted from November 4-19.</p>
<p>					   Base    Forecast</p>
<p>INFLATION RATES</p>
<p>    Germany			    1.4     1.5</p>
<p>    U.S.				 3.0     3.2</p>
<p>    Japan			     -0.1     0.1</p>
<p>    Britain			    2.1     2.3</p>
<p>    France			     1.6     1.7</p>
<p>    Italy				3.0     3.0</p>
<p>SHORT-TERM RATES (Three-month interbank rates)</p>
<p>    Germany			    3.1     3.2</p>
<p>    U.S.				 5.4     5.7</p>
<p>    Japan				0.4     0.7</p>
<p>    Britain			    6.3     6.6</p>
<p>    France			     3.4     3.4</p>
<p>    Italy				7.5     7.4</p>
<p>LONG-TERM RATES</p>
<p>    Germany			    5.9     6.1</p>
<p>    U.S.				 6.2     6.6</p>
<p>    Japan				2.7     3.1</p>
<p>    Britain			    7.8     8.0</p>
<p>    France			     5.9     6.0</p>
<p>    Italy				7.8     7.9</p>
<p>BOURSE</p>
<p>    German DAX			2,750   2,830</p>
<p>    U.S. Dow Jones		  6,250   6,200</p>
<p>    Japan Nikkei		   21,000  21,800</p>
<p>    Britain FT-SE 100	     3,940   3,940</p>
<p>    France CAC-40		   2,220   2,320</p>
<p>    Italy MIBtel		   10,100  10,600</p>
<p>EXCHANGE RATES VS MARK</p>
<p>    Swiss franc		     1.19    1.16</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar		     1.50    1.55</p>
<p>    Japanese yen		    1.35    1.35</p>
<p>    British pound		   2.49    2.51</p>
<p>    French franc		    2.95    2.94</p>
<p>    Italian lira		    0.99    0.98</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
